  "style": {
    "id": "cardboard-stop-motion",
    "name": "Cardboard Stop-Motion",
    "description": "A hand-built corrugated-cardboard set on a workbench under a warm clamp lamp: kraft cut-outs with wavy fluted cut edges and wonky hand-cut outlines, marker-pen drawings and lettering, masking tape and brass split-pin joints; everything (camera included) is animated on threes with per-pose jitter and lamp flicker, puppets rotate about split pins, and pieces slide, stand up on tabs and are swapped like replacement animation.",
